321
00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:34.120
Sean.

322
00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:35.180
Did you see it?

323
00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:36.300
Yes, I saw it.

324
00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:37.480
I was so embarrassed.

325
00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:38.880
I was so embarrassed.

326
00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:43.720
I clearly was just really tired because it's a really big yawn.

327
00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:44.340
Yeah.

328
00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:47.020
1 minute 23 seconds, everyone.

329
00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:48.880
It was an early morning.

