445
00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.420
Usually you have to make up a name for a product.

446
00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:39.080
But they were excited about the script, and they loved the episode.

447
00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:45.640
Yes, Angela, Steve Burgess said that once Phil got permission from Nespresso,

448
00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:52.740
they still had to get NBC Sales to sign off on it because we were basically giving Nespresso a free commercial.

449
00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:55.060
This was not paid product placement.

450
00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:59.480
This was us writing an episode and just asking permission to use their machine.

451
00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:07.040
And Steve Burgess said they were a little reluctant because, you know, it was just like free advertising,

452
00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:08.420
