453
00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:11.460
Oh, yeah, NBC, I'm sure, was like, show me the money.

454
00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:12.260
Because it is.

455
00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:14.240
It's like an amazing ad forever.

456
00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:16.220
I know, it's true.

457
00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:18.320
And Maddie is right.

458
00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:24.700
That box is placed perfectly on reception, and we see this machine throughout the whole episode.

459
00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:28.580
Well, it sounds like they were Office fans, and I just think it's great.

460
00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.260
I'm glad that they said yes.

