00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:18.520
It's an amazing job with some great, hardworking students, plus the perks of coffee.

471
00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:23.960
Carrie says, be sure to use the free recycling bags from Nespresso, and it will get shipped

472
00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:27.320
to us and be recycled properly and stay out of a landfill.

473
00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:28.720
Thank you, Carrie.

474
00:22:29.140 --> 00:22:30.320
Yeah, I love that.

