00:22:30.520 --> 00:22:35.700
I did a little mini deep dive on this, and I watched a bunch of videos, and I was seeing

476
00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:39.820
this recycling program and this real attempt to be more environmentally conscious.

477
00:22:40.340 --> 00:22:41.400
It was really cool.

478
00:22:41.400 --> 00:22:45.400
So when you get Nespresso, because I don't have one, it comes with the little recycle

479
00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:47.320
bag, and then you send that back?

