00:22:56.960 --> 00:23:01.700
And then you send it, and then it all gets taken care of.

486
00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:02.720
They separate it.

487
00:23:03.320 --> 00:23:03.920
Recycle it.

488
00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:04.600
Do all of it.

489
00:23:04.760 --> 00:23:05.380
That's great.

490
00:23:05.380 --> 00:23:05.880
I know.

491
00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:10.340
Yeah, I just really liked Carrie's letter because I loved how much she loved her job.

492
00:23:10.340 --> 00:23:11.980
I always love when people love their job.

493
00:23:12.140 --> 00:23:14.160
I also love to learn about new jobs.

494
00:23:14.520 --> 00:23:14.820
Mm-hmm.

495
00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:17.700
Now that Clark is back, Dwight's wheels are turning.

