Phil Shea found the dead fish that we ultimately used.

1445
01:04:42.280 --> 01:04:47.500
You know, some were floating at the top of the tank and some were tied to monofilament.

1446
01:04:47.500 --> 01:04:50.460
So they would float in the middle of the tank.

1447
01:04:50.780 --> 01:05:00.280
The challenge that we had was to find the live fish to match the dead ones that Phil had found, which we ultimately did, you know,

1448
