And I believe that Craig made that shot on the first take, but we did ultimately reset and did it a second time.

1450
01:05:17.480 --> 01:05:18.740
I'm sorry.

1451
01:05:19.000 --> 01:05:19.300
Yeah.

1452
01:05:19.560 --> 01:05:20.940
You can buy dead fish.

1453
